---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const seo = {
  title: "Retirement Planning India: Track Your Corpus | Arthavi",
  description: "Effective retirement planning starts with tracking your current corpus. Monitor your long-term investments in Mutual Funds and Stocks with Arthavi.",
};
---
<Layout title={seo.title} description={seo.description} keywords="retirement planning, retirement corpus india, pension planning, long term investing, financial freedom" schema={JSON.stringify({"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebPage","name":"Retirement Planning India","description":"Effective retirement planning starts with tracking your current corpus. Monitor your long-term investments in Mutual Funds and Stocks.","url":"https://arthavi.com/retirement-planning"})} breadcrumb={{items:[{name:"Home",url:"https://arthavi.com/"},{name:"Retirement Planning",url:"https://arthavi.com/retirement-planning"}]}}>

    

    <main class="container">
        <section class="page-header fade-in">
            <h1>Retirement Planning: Secure Your Future</h1>
            <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: 1.2rem; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
                Retirement isn't an age, it's a financial number. Track your progress towards that number with
                precision.
            </p>
        </section>

        <article class="prose fade-in delay-100">
            <h2>The Importance of Early Planning</h2>
            <p><strong>Retirement buying</strong> is the biggest financial goal for most Indians. With rising healthcare
                costs and inflation, relying solely on EPF or PPF is often not enough. You need a mix of high-growth
                assets like equity and stable assets like debt.</p>

            <h2>Building the Corpus</h2>
            <p>To reach your retirement goal, you need consistent investing (SIPs) and the magic of compounding. But how
                do you know if you are on track?</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Track Growth:</strong> Monitor the CAGR/XIRR of your long-term portfolio.</li>
                <li><strong>Review Allocation:</strong> Ensure you reduce risk as you get closer to retirement.</li>
                <li><strong>Consolidated View:</strong> See your PPF, Mutual Funds, and Stocks in one place.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>Tools to Help</h2>
            <p>Use our <a href="/sip-calculator" style="color:var(--primary)">SIP Calculator</a> to estimate how
                much your current investments will grow to. Use the <a href="/swp-calculator"
                    style="color:var(--primary)">SWP Calculator</a> to plan your post-retirement monthly income.</p>

            <p>And most importantly, use <strong>Arthavi</strong> to keep a hawk-eye on your actual retirement portfolio
                today.</p>

            <div style="margin-top: 3rem; text-align: center;">
                <h3>Track Your Road to Retirement</h3>
                <a href="https://app.arthavi.com" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top: 1rem;">Start Tracking</a>
            </div>
        </article>
    </main>

    
    

</Layout>
